      "comment": "HURRY UP ERIC (2) is a well performed dog and winner of 12 races who was in the minor money last time out at Mandurah (27.39). Has a good record here at this journey. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Sure to be about the mark. MAILATA (1) finished in the money fresh when second (22.71) at Mandurah in a Free For All. Has a good record here including 13 wins. Has a strong record out of this box with four wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Expecting another good run. SUNSET CALIGULA (8) has a strong record this track and trip with 16 wins and seven placings from 27 starts. Was out of the placings last time (28.11) at Mandurah in a OPEN, finishing fifth and beaten 12 lengths. Makes strong appeal on best. GREAT CHAT (3) missed the frame latest (27.65) when fourth over 488m at Mandurah in a OPEN. Has two wins already from this draw.",
